<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <link rel="manifest" href="/static/manifest.webmanifest">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0f172a">
  <meta name="description" content="Rozilikka asoslangan xodim GPS kuzatuv tizimi">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/static/icons/icon-192.png">
  <script>if("serviceWorker" in navigator){window.addEventListener("load",function(){navigator.serviceWorker.register("/sw.js").catch(function(){})})}</script>
  <title>GPS Monitoring</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, #1e3a8a 0%, #0f172a 70%); color: #e2e8f0; margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 1.5rem; text-align: center; }
    .logo { width: 96px; height: 96px; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin: 1rem 0 .25rem; }
    p { color: #cbd5e1; font-size: .95rem; max-width: 420px; line-height: 1.5; }
    a.btn { display: inline-block; margin-top: 1.5rem; padding: .85rem 1.75rem; border-radius: 10px; background: #2563eb; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; }
    .foot { margin-top: 2rem; font-size: .78rem; color: #94a3b8; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <img class="logo" src="/static/icons/icon-192.png" alt="GPS Monitoring">
  <h1>GPS Monitoring</h1>
  <p>Rozilikka asoslangan xodim GPS kuzatuv tizimi. Xodim faqat o'z roziligi bilan va kuzatuv faol ekanini ko'rib turgan holda kuzatiladi.</p>
  <a class="btn" href="/admin/login">Admin kirish</a>
  <div class="foot">Xodimlar o'zlariga yuborilgan shaxsiy havola orqali kiradilar.</div>
</body>
</html>
